  <item>
    <title>EP.05 为什么平台对于擦边内容如此暧昧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d823f1b9a8d0121b1d9e9d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d823f1b9a8d0121b1d9e9d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3><span>👋 欢迎来到本期的 Middleman | 超展开 播客节目！</span></h3><span></span><p><span>我们是不是都碰到过这样的场景：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>无意间刷到擦边视频的时候——“卧槽，可别被人看到了”；</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>沙发上抬头一看，男朋友在看擦边视频——“这家伙是欠收拾了”；</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>又刷到一条擦边视频——“emmmm我要不要看呢” “就看一下吧”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>在这一期节目中和贱圆@</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669a701837236c546e5a5e77" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669a701837236c546e5a5e77"><span>各站停靠</span></a><span> 和@小狐狸，从上海一位女律师兼职做擦边播主开始说起，聊聊擦边视频背后的平台态度，擦边对内容消费者来说意味着什么，创作者到底在想什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>点击播放，让我们开始这段旅程吧！ 🎧✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:00:12</a> 从女律师的擦边兼职开始说起...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">00:01:39</a> 无孔不入的擦边内容，平台推荐机制的“锅”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">00:06:39</a> 内容平台的暧昧态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">00:10:47</a> 一个把抖音推荐训练成只有擦边视频的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">00:12:34</a> XP都不同，怎么定义擦边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">00:14:38</a> 擦边播主，塑造标签还是消费标签</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">00:15:25</a> 你会和你的伴侣去对齐什么是擦边视频吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">00:16:03</a> 我们能把擦边视频也看成是一种商品吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">00:20:09</a> 景观消费主义和自我物化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">00:25:42</a> 我觉得你该多刷刷抖音！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">00:29:42</a> 总结，三种视角下的擦边审视</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家的支持，期待和你在评论区的交流</span></p><span></span><p><span>🙌 MiddleLife，MiddleMan！让我们超展开生活~</span></p>]]></description>
